---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy Policy | DevNotes"
	description="Read how DevNotes handles reader data: privacy-friendly analytics, no advertising trackers, contact form messages and your data rights."
>
	<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
	<p class="meta">Last updated: 1 September 2026</p>

	<section class="prose">
		<p>
			DevNotes is a reading-first website. We collect as little personal information as possible and
			never sell or share it with advertisers. This page explains exactly what we collect and why.
		</p>

		<h2>Analytics</h2>
		<p>
			We use a self-hosted, cookie-free analytics tool that records page views, referrers and
			approximate country. It does not store IP addresses or build profiles of individual readers,
			and the data is used only to understand which guides are useful.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact messages</h2>
		<p>
			When you email us or use the contact form, we keep your name, email address and message so that
			we can reply. Messages are deleted after twelve months unless they relate to an ongoing guest
			article or correction.
		</p>

		<h2>Cookies and third parties</h2>
		<p>
			DevNotes sets no tracking cookies and loads no advertising scripts. Sponsored placements are
			plain images and links hosted on our own domain, so sponsors cannot track you.
		</p>

		<h2>Your rights</h2>
		<p>
			You can ask us for a copy of any data we hold about you, or ask us to delete it, by emailing
			<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We respond within thirty days.
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
